{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "満開っ!🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6期生の長嶋凛桜(ながしまりお)です!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日も読みに来てくれてありがとう☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近はすっかり寒くなりましたね🍃\n皆さん、風邪引いてないですか?"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "電車に乗っても街を歩いても\n風邪を引いてる方を沢山見かける季節になりました😭‎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "咳をしている方に全員漏れなくのど飴を配りたくなります"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつでもあげるんだからっ🍬🍭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "栄養満点の食事とたっぷりの睡眠が鍵ですからね!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "暖かくして行きましょう!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近の1枚"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobts7HrK.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "じーーーーーーーーっ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "目力たぬき"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "目力には自信があるのです👀"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この日は佑捺と紅葉デートに行ったの🍁"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "自然に囲まれて幸せでしたෆ˚*"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobijaw6G.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "道中に生えていた柚子の木🍊"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2人で歩きながらずーーっと\n蜜柑なのか柚子なのかで議論してました笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "多分これは柚子です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "さてさて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まずは!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日のオンラインミート&グリート\nありがとうございました!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobeWV1lv.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "珍しく猫"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "来週も皆さんに会えるから\nとても楽しみですっ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちょっと遅くなるけど\nクリスマスも近いからね^^ﾆﾔｯ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログとかメッセージのお話も沢山できて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近気になって来てみましたって方も沢山いらっしゃって嬉しい限りですෆ˚*"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またお話しましょうね☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "さてと、\n今日はコメントで頂いた質問に答えようかな♪"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "📮やりたくないけどやらなきゃいけないタスクがある時どうする？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私の場合は課題ですね笑\nうーんとね､､\n一気にこなそうとせずに分割します!\n嫌な科目のあとは好きな科目を勉強したり、30分頑張った後にご褒美をあげるとか"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "焦らずコツコツ確実に!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "学生さんの中には今勉強を頑張ってる方も沢山いますよね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "テスト、受験、資格勉強、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それぞれ色々な不安があると思うけど\n周りに何と言われても\nせめて自分だけは自分をちゃんと信じてあげましょう✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大丈夫。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "📮ラジオを聴くようになったきっかけはなんですか?"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とある女優さんのラジオを聴いたのがきっかけ。\nラジオ通の友達とその番組の話をするのが楽しくて色々な番組を教えてもらいました‪💡‬"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "📮りおたんも｢弓道体操｣してたの？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "えーとですね､､､\n知りませんっ!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "体操はしなかったけど、\nゴム弓で練習して、射型を確認してから立ちに入るようにしてました🏹"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また弓引きたいなぁ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんは学生時代、何部に入ってましたか?"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "部活あるあるとか知りたいです👀"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "長嶋の弓道あるあるはねぇ〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆中(4本全部的に当たること)した時に\nすごく爽やかな顔してるけど\n内心はものすごく喜んでること"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "頭の中はリオのカーニバル状態です💃"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日はここらで失礼します"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また書くね☺︎"}], "source": "official"}